new = '''/// The two VMs have to agree about *where* a failure happened, over the whole
/// corpus.
///
/// Every corpus program, both halves, with the position compared on its own
/// rather than as part of the whole outcome. This is the assertion that was
/// impossible to write before `Outcome` carried a position at all, and it is
/// separate from `every_corpus_program_agrees_between_the_two_vms` on purpose:
